{
    "title": "Dashboard Best Practices Template",
    "description": "A reusable template for documenting dashboard design, ownership, and maintenance standards.",
    "defaults": {
        "dataSources": {
            "ds.search": {
                "options": {
                    "queryParameters": {
                        "earliest": "$global_time.earliest$",
                        "latest": "$global_time.latest$"
                    }
                }
            },
            "ds.spl2": {
                "options": {
                    "queryParameters": {
                        "earliest": "$global_time.earliest$",
                        "latest": "$global_time.latest$"
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "visualizations": {
            "global": {
                "showProgressBar": true
            }
        }
    },
    "visualizations": {
        "viz_code_bg": {
            "options": {
                "fillColor": "#071A2F",
                "strokeColor": "#4EA1FF"
            },
            "type": "splunk.rectangle"
        },
        "viz_code_text": {
            "options": {
                "customFontSize": 15,
                "fontColor": "#FFFFFF",
                "fontSize": "custom",
                "markdown": "```text\nDashboard Name: [ENTER DASHBOARD NAME]\nDescription: [ENTER A SHORT DASHBOARD DESCRIPTION]\nCreated By: [ENTER CREATOR OR TEAM]\nMaintained By: [ENTER CURRENT OWNER OR SUPPORT TEAM]\nLast Updated Date: [ENTER DATE]\nData Sources: [ENTER DATA SOURCES]\nPurpose Statement: [ENTER THE BUSINESS OR TECHNICAL PURPOSE]\nDocumentation: [ENTER DOCUMENTATION URL OR LOCATION]\nSupport Contact: [ENTER SUPPORT CONTACT OR TEAM]\n```"
            },
            "type": "splunk.markdown"
        },
        "viz_code_title": {
            "options": {
                "customFontSize": 24,
                "fontColor": "#FFFFFF",
                "fontSize": "custom",
                "markdown": "🧩 Paste-Ready Metadata Template"
            },
            "type": "splunk.markdown"
        },
        "viz_control_bg": {
            "options": {
                "fillColor": "#102D4F",
                "strokeColor": "#3E8BFF"
            },
            "type": "splunk.rectangle"
        },
        "viz_control_text": {
            "options": {
                "customFontSize": 17,
                "fontColor": "#FFFFFF",
                "fontSize": "custom",
                "markdown": "**Version:** [ENTER VERSION]  \n**Effective Date:** [ENTER DATE]  \n**Maintained By:** [ENTER TEAM OR OWNER]  \n**Review Cycle:** [ENTER REVIEW FREQUENCY]  \n**Notes:** [ENTER DOCUMENT NOTES]"
            },
            "type": "splunk.markdown"
        },
        "viz_control_title": {
            "options": {
                "customFontSize": 24,
                "fontColor": "#FFFFFF",
                "fontSize": "custom",
                "markdown": "🗂️ Document Control"
            },
            "type": "splunk.markdown"
        },
        "viz_design_bg": {
            "options": {
                "fillColor": "#1C3354",
                "strokeColor": "#4EA1FF"
            },
            "type": "splunk.rectangle"
        },
        "viz_design_text": {
            "options": {
                "customFontSize": 16,
                "fontColor": "#FFFFFF",
                "fontSize": "custom",
                "markdown": "[ENTER YOUR ORGANIZATION'S DASHBOARD DESIGN STANDARDS]\n\nSuggested topics:\n- Panel titles and descriptions\n- Layout and visual hierarchy\n- Colors and formatting\n- Filters and time selectors\n- Accessibility\n- User experience expectations"
            },
            "type": "splunk.markdown"
        },
        "viz_design_title": {
            "options": {
                "customFontSize": 24,
                "fontColor": "#FFFFFF",
                "fontSize": "custom",
                "markdown": "🎨 Design Consistency"
            },
            "type": "splunk.markdown"
        },
        "viz_example_bg": {
            "options": {
                "fillColor": "#1A2438",
                "strokeColor": "#F26A21"
            },
            "type": "splunk.rectangle"
        },
        "viz_example_text": {
            "options": {
                "customFontSize": 16,
                "fontColor": "#FFFFFF",
                "fontSize": "custom",
                "markdown": "**Dashboard Name:** [ENTER EXAMPLE DASHBOARD NAME]  \n**Description:** [ENTER EXAMPLE DESCRIPTION]  \n**Created By:** [ENTER CREATOR OR TEAM]  \n**Maintained By:** [ENTER CURRENT OWNER]  \n**Data Sources:** [ENTER DATA SOURCES]  \n**Purpose:** [ENTER BUSINESS OR TECHNICAL PURPOSE]  \n**Last Updated:** [ENTER DATE]"
            },
            "type": "splunk.markdown"
        },
        "viz_example_title": {
            "options": {
                "customFontSize": 24,
                "fontColor": "#FFFFFF",
                "fontSize": "custom",
                "markdown": "📌 Example Metadata"
            },
            "type": "splunk.markdown"
        },
